Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statement_list

    2 statement_list: statement
    3               | statement_list statement

    4 statement: declaration_stmt
    5          | assignment_stmt
    6          | expression SEMICOLON
    7          | if_stmt
    8          | while_stmt
    9          | for_stmt
   10          | switch_stmt
   11          | function_decl
   12          | do_while_stmt
   13          | return_stmt
   14          | function_call SEMICOLON

   15 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   16                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   17                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   18 type: INT
   19     | FLOAT_TYPE
   20     | STRING_TYPE
   21     | CHAR_TYPE

   22 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   23 assign: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   24 expression: expression PLUS T
   25           | expression MINUS T
   26           | T

   27 T: T MULTIPLY F
   28  | T DIVIDE F
   29  | T MODULO F
   30  | F

   31 F: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   32  | MINUS F
   33  | IDENTIFIER
   34  | FLOAT
   35  | NUMBER

   36 condition: expression EQUAL expression
   37          | expression NOT_EQUAL expression
   38          | expression LESS_THAN expression
   39          | expression GREATER_THAN expression
   40          | expression LESS_EQUAL expression
   41          | expression GREATER_EQUAL expression
   42          | expression AND expression
   43          | expression OR expression
   44          | NOT expression

   45 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   46        | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   47 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   48 for_stmt: FOR LPAREN declaration_stmt condition SEMICOLON assign RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   49 switch_stmt: SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list RBRACE
   50            | SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list default_case RBRACE

   51 case_list: case_stmt
   52          | case_list case_stmt

   53 case_stmt: CASE expression COLON statement_list
   54          | CASE expression COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   55 default_case: DEFAULT COLON statement_list
   56             | DEFAULT COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   57 function_decl: type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   58              | type IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   59              | VOID_TYPE IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   60 parameter_list: parameter
   61               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   62 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   63 return_stmt: RETURN expression SEMICOLON
   64            | RETURN SEMICOLON

   65 do_while_stmt: DO LBRACE statement_list RBRACE WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN SEMICOLON

   66 function_call: IDENTIFIER LPAREN argument_list RPAREN
   67              | IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN

   68 argument_list: expression
   69              | argument_list COMMA expression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

$end (0) 0
error (256)
INT (258) 18
FLOAT_TYPE (259) 19
STRING_TYPE (260) 20
