    on left: 18 19 20 21, on right: 15 16 17 57 58 62
assignment_stmt (50)
    on left: 22, on right: 5
assign (51)
    on left: 23, on right: 48
expression (52)
    on left: 24 25 26, on right: 6 16 17 22 23 24 25 31 36 37 38 39
    40 41 42 43 44 53 54 63 68 69
T (53)
    on left: 27 28 29 30, on right: 24 25 26 27 28 29
F (54)
    on left: 31 32 33 34 35, on right: 27 28 29 30 32
condition (55)
    on left: 36 37 38 39 40 41 42 43 44, on right: 45 46 47 48 65
